WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
- Who here is already pro basketball player?

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
- Mr. Dončić, they're only seven.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
- You are behind! Children, I am ancient 23-year-old.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.250
I've had it all figured out for decade plus.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.875
See? I know this. It's magic portaaaaal.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.333
- [Modern announcer:] Welcome to the arena outside of space and time,

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:22.916
where we have The Wonder Boy, The Matador:
2022 Luka Dončić.

00:00:22.916 --> 00:00:26.000
- [Old-school announcer:] Versus 2008 Paul Pierce!
[club music]

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.500
- [Chuckling] I don't think so.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.375
Give me a real challenge. I am HalleLuka.

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:31.750
I am Luka Magic!

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.000
- [Old-school announcer:] Have it your way, kid.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.750
 Your challenger will be multiple championship-winning,

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:40.375
Finals and league MVP, 1987...

00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:44.291
 Earvin "Magic" Johnson.

00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:47.875
- It's an incredible honor to be with 
you floating balls of light tonight.

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.041
- Woo, he smiled at me!
- No, he smiled at me!

00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:51.958
- Hey, Ivan Drago, is this real?

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:54.958
- No, not Real. NBA.

00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:57.208
- Oh, cocky, huh? You remind me of someone.

00:00:58.666 --> 00:01:01.166
- [Old-school announcer:] Oh, Magic with the razzle-dazzle.

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:05.333
- [Modern announcer:] Magic misses a three, 
showing he'd have no place in today's game.

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:09.291
- [Old-school announcer:] Luka's mesmerizing. 
Like watching a tuna can do ballet.

00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:14.750
- Ladies and gentleman: Showtime!

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:21.708
-Oh!

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:23.791
-Sorry, Magic Man, not my tempo.

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:40.083
- A white boy who can play? I think I know you.

00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:45.708
Back to back, yeah!

00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:47.333
- I don't back down, Earvin.
[record scratch]

00:01:48.291 --> 00:01:50.416
 I hit step-backs.

00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:52.291
-Larry.

00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:54.958
I'd know that slow, old-man game anywhere.

00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:59.291
- [Old-school announcer:] I have not seen that look since the 1987 Lakers/Celtics Finals!

00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:02.625
- Nice try with that terrible Euro disguise, 
you dumb hick.

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:05.458
- Hick? I'm from Ljubljana. It's a big city.

00:02:07.416 --> 00:02:10.416
-Magic fakes, Luka bites...Magic scores!

00:02:10.416 --> 00:02:12.208
-Sorry, everyone. I was seeing green.

00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:14.833
-[Crowd laughing] I don't get it, but he's so charming.

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:17.666
- Game point, Magic with the junior sky hook...

00:02:17.666 --> 00:02:18.541
- [Old-school announcer:] Magic wins!

00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:20.958
- Hey, let's do this again when you're grown.

00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:23.166
-How do you like that schoolin', kid?

00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:29.083
- Is it possible I do not have it all figured out 
in my four NBA seasons?

00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:31.916
Maybe there is hope for you children. Begin!

00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:34.208
- [Gasps] Ow!
- OK, you gotta catch that.

00:02:40.875 --> 00:02:42.500
- [Modern announcer:] Ok, so crypto is a type of-

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.041
- [Old-school announcer:] No. It'll never catch on.

00:02:44.041 --> 00:02:45.500
- Didn't you say that about...

00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:47.041
- A three point line?

00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:48.333
No one's going to be 
able to make that.

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:50.500
Look how far it is from the hoop!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.541
I stand by that one. 
Ruined the game.

00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:55.333
- FTX. Don't miss out on the next big thing

